  <!-- EN: eldritch cult -->
  <VME_Structure_ChthonianCult.label>culto ctónico</VME_Structure_ChthonianCult.label>
  <!-- EN: There are ancient entities in this Universe that are more powerful than mere gods. Immensely powerful and utterly indifferent to us humans who can barely begin to comprehend them. Only by worshipping them can we hope to placate their ire. -->
  <VME_Structure_ChthonianCult.description>Hay entidades antiguas en este Universo que son más poderosas que los meros dioses. Inmensamente poderosas y totalmente indiferentes a nosotros, los humanos, que apenas podemos empezar a comprenderlas. Solo adorándolas podemos esperar aplacar su ira.</VME_Structure_ChthonianCult.description>
